        "dawasteh_generated_note": true
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Erklärung · CLIP Text Encode (Positive Prompt) · Node 6\n\n**Zweck:** Encodes a text prompt using a CLIP model into an embedding that can be used to guide the diffusion model towards generating specific images.\n\n**Einstellbare Werte**\n- `text` = `Replace the background with falling snow and soft light, keep the character identical and keep the same frami…` — The text to be encoded. Ändert den Text bzw. die Anweisung, die dieser Node verarbeitet.\n\n**Eingänge**\n- `clip` (CLIP, Link 235): The CLIP model used for encoding the text.\n\n**Ausgänge**\n- `CONDITIONING` (CONDITIONING, 2 Verbindung(en)): A conditioning containing the embedded text used to guide the diffusion model."
      ],
      "color": "#1b2638",
      "bgcolor": "#101722"
    },
